id=ldnal20-wlan
name=LDN-AL20 WLAN kickstart fix
version=2.0
versionCode=2
author=WorkBuddy
description=Starts the built-in prima WLAN driver on custom kernel V6 by writing /sys/module/wlan/parameters/con_mode (which invokes kickstart_driver()). Replaces the stock trigger /proc/wifi_built_in/wifi_start that is absent from Huawei's published source tree. No wlan.ko needed - the driver is built into the kernel image.
